{"id":"Prowl.Runtime.NavMeshModifierVolume","name":"NavMeshModifierVolume","display":"NavMeshModifierVolume","kind":"class","assembly":"Prowl.Runtime","namespace":"Prowl.Runtime","outer":null,"signature":"public class NavMeshModifierVolume : Component","bases":[{"name":"Component","id":"Prowl.Runtime.Component"}],"docs":{"summary":"Stamps an area over a world region during navmesh bakes, independent of which objects the geometry came from — mark a danger zone, make a doorway expensive, or (with Not Walkable) erase walkability inside the box. The volume only re-marks surface that geometry produced; it never creates walkable surface. Applied during full bakes AND partial rebuilds whose tiles intersect it; like modifiers, changing a volume does not rebake anything by itself. When toggling or moving a volume at runtime, rebuild its ENTIRE footprint region — rebuilding a sub-region leaves the stamp half-applied in the untouched tiles."},"attributes":["AddComponentMenu","ComponentIcon"],"members":[{"kind":"property","name":"Center","signature":"public Float3 Center { get; set; }","docs":{},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":35,"path":"Prowl.Runtime/Components/Navigation/NavMeshModifierVolume.cs","anchor":"Center"},{"kind":"property","name":"Size","signature":"public Float3 Size { get; set; }","docs":{},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":36,"path":"Prowl.Runtime/Components/Navigation/NavMeshModifierVolume.cs","anchor":"Size"},{"kind":"property","name":"Area","signature":"public NavMeshArea Area { get; set; }","docs":{},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":37,"path":"Prowl.Runtime/Components/Navigation/NavMeshModifierVolume.cs","anchor":"Area"},{"kind":"property","name":"AgentTypes","signature":"public NavMeshAgentTypeSet AgentTypes { get; set; }","docs":{},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":38,"path":"Prowl.Runtime/Components/Navigation/NavMeshModifierVolume.cs","anchor":"AgentTypes"},{"kind":"method","name":"AffectsAgentType","signature":"public bool Affects